  "releaseNotes": "The Symphony Core Connector Extensions.\n\nSymphony Core is a high-performance enterprise platform that unifies business data, workflows, and integrations in one reliable backend foundation.\n\nSymphony Core is the backend platform of Symphony. Applications communicate with the Symphony Core Server through the connector layer.\n\nThis package extends the base Connector package with additional helper and convenience APIs, including utility functions and extension-oriented functionality for common integration tasks.\n\nUse Connector (base package) in all cases, because this package builds on top of it. Add Connector.WinForms.Extensions only when your application is a Windows Forms client that needs UI controls for visualizing connector-related structures.",
